<title>USA: GPU restores power to 40,000 NJ customers.</title>
<headline>GPU restores power to 40,000 NJ customers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Public Utilities Corp has restored all electricity service to the 40,000 New Jersey customers affected by this weekend's heavy rains that pounded the U.S. Northeast, the company said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;About 40,000 customers were affected early Saturday morning. Of the 40,000, the majority of the service was back by Sunday morning,&quot; said a company spokesman, noting full power was restored by Sunday afternoon.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
</text>
